### GIS Approach

The original sampling coordinates were recorded in Degrees, Minutes and Seconds (DMS) and have been converted to Decimal Degrees for use in QGIS.

I will plot the nine sampling locations using **longitude as X and latitude as Y** with **WGS 84 (EPSG:4326)**. The concentration values for each of the six elements will then be used to compare the sampling locations and visualise their spatial variation along the river.
